WEBVTT

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.426
moždani udar,

00:00:31.426 --> 00:00:34.900
ušla sam u njegovu sobu 
na intenzivnoj njezi

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.884
na Neurološkom institutu u Montrealu

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:40.527
i vidjela ga kako leži mirno kao mrtvac,

00:00:40.527 --> 00:00:43.463
priključen na uređaj za disanje.

00:00:43.463 --> 00:00:47.894
Paraliza mu je polako oduzimala tijelo,

00:00:47.894 --> 00:00:49.965
najprije nožne prste, zatim noge,

00:00:49.965 --> 00:00:52.495
prsa, prste i ruke.

00:00:52.495 --> 00:00:54.700
Konačno se proširila i na vrat,

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.905
onemogućavajući mu disanje

00:00:56.905 --> 00:01:00.252
i zaustavila se točno ispod očiju.